# Version 004010 segments for the transportation sets Trenova reads and writes (204, 210, 214,
# 990) and the functional acknowledgment (997). Written from trading partners' published
# implementation guides for these sets. Element lengths, types, usage and syntax notes are the
# standard's; code lists are kept only where they are short and stable, since a partner's guide
# restricts the rest.

